  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nWhat is your happy place?<p></p>\n<p>Maybe it’s a bedroom. A calm place in the open. Your bathroom. Or maybe… your personal computer?</p>\n<p>During times of need, a programmer developed a virtual cozy experience for his girlfriend.</p>\n<p>It was a warm, isolated wood cabin on the snowy alps. With a chill-out music playing on the background, a nice place to say for a while…</p>\n<p>… if not by a system bug on the basement, showing a hidden path to another world.</p>\n<p>On Fida Puti Samurai, you will incarnate as Liza, digging through a silly kind of rabbit hole:</p>\n[b]Game Features[/b]\n<ul>\n<li>Traverse urban environments\n</li><li>Visit 13 levels on urban settings\n</li><li>Fight bunny-suit zombies, semi-naked waifus, punk gurls and others on 4 different enemy factions\n</li><li>Use a wide variety of weapons from sledgehammers to dynamite and even panty-drying miniguns\n</li><li>Discover the ability to transform into a Mahou Shoujo\n</li><li>Uncover the secrets that lie on Zanardi’s computer and his past\n</li></ul>\n",
